---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import CTABanner from '../components/CTABanner.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="How We Work — 1404 | Simple solutions to complex problems"
  description="How 1404 works: simple solutions to complex problems, built together with the person who owns the problem, combining your knowledge of the business with how we build, and refined through fast feedback loops until it fits."
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pt-40 pb-24 md:pb-32">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-20">
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-text-primary leading-tight">
        How we work
      </h1>
    </header>

    <!-- Philosophy -->
    <div class="mb-24">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-primary mb-6 max-w-3xl">
        Simple solutions to complex problems.
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        <p>
          The problems that hold a business back are usually complex. Lots of moving parts, years of context, details that live in the heads of the people who deal with them every day. Our job is to turn that into something simple that works.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do it together. Nobody knows your business the way your team does, and building tailored solutions is what we do, so we combine the two. We work directly with whoever owns the problem, the CEO, the COO, the head of sales, whoever lives with it day to day. We get a simple version working fast, then refine it through short feedback loops until it fits the real nuance of how your company runs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The method -->
    <div class="mb-20 border-t border-border pt-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl text-text-primary mb-12">
        How that works in practice.
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-12">

        <div class="border-l-2 border-copper pl-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-3xl md:text-4xl text-copper mb-4 tracking-wide">01</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-text-primary mb-3">We work through it together</h3>
          <p class="text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            We sit down with whoever owns the problem and combine what you know about your business with how we build. Your expertise and ours, shaping a simple, tailored solution.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-2 border-copper pl-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-3xl md:text-4xl text-copper mb-4 tracking-wide">02</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-text-primary mb-3">We get a simple fix up fast</h3>
          <p class="text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            We build the simplest version that solves the core of it and put it to work quickly, so you see something real and start getting value early instead of waiting months for a big rollout.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-2 border-copper pl-8">
          <p class="font-mono text-3xl md:text-4xl text-copper mb-4 tracking-wide">03</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-text-primary mb-3">We iterate until it fits</h3>
          <p class="text-text-body text-base leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            Then we keep refining it through short feedback loops, each round handling more of the nuance, until it fits exactly how your company works.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <CTABanner />
</PageLayout>
